error[type-mismatch] 4:19-4:32
    (map (fn [r] (+ (get r :size) 1)) all))
                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  This is an Option<Int>, but an Int is needed here.
  Expected: Int
  Found: Option<Int>
  The records that reach this point do not all have :size: the record at 3:40 has none.
  Sx does not narrow a field by a flag such as :known, so testing a flag does not make :size present.
  Match on it, or give get a default: (get r :size DEFAULT).
  Fix: (match (get r :size) (some size) ... none ...)
